---
title: Buckeyes
source: Grandma Schwennesen
---

Line a #baking sheet{} with waxed paper.

In a #medium bowl{}, mix the @creamy peanut butter{1-1/2%cups}, @butter{1/3%cup}(softened), @vanilla{1%tsp}, and @confectioner's sugar{4%cups}(sifted) with your hands to form a smooth and stiff dough.

Shape into balls using about 2 tsp of dough per ball.

Refrigerate for ~{several%hours}.

Insert a toothpick into each ball and dip them into the melted @dipping chocolate{1%package}.
